matched to the two literal marked sections. Both lie below O₂(H), with exactly
one on O₂(H)/C_H(U). Refinements also retain the intersections with L₁.

The source applications discharge the dual-coordinate premise using the
precise earlier 14.5.21 duality and commutator identity, which remain explicit
earlier-source inputs. Final L₁ counting and [Q,L]≤S remain with the
ChiefFactors owner.
